  "bio": "Victor Johan Prattley is a renowned fineline tattoo artist based in Christchurch, New Zealand. His meticulous attention to detail and precision in this intricate style has elevated him to a high level of skill in the tattooing community. Clients visiting his studio, Laneways Tattoo, consistently praise the professionalism that Victor ensures throughout the entire tattooing process, making each session as exceptional as the artwork itself.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Christchurch, Canterbury, New Zealand"
